### 2. Master Post-Quantum Key (Post-Quantum Channel)

Used for post-quantum key encapsulation mechanism (KEM), immune to quantum computer cryptanalysis (Harvest Now, Decrypt Later resistant).

=> /nymserver-pq-pubkey.bin Download nymserver-pq-pubkey.bin (1184 bytes)

